
Change-log for SpeechPlugin.dll

------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
13/10/26  v0.7.0.0 :
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
	Windows OneCore voices (Julie, Paul, Hortense...) in addition to SAPI voices
	Voice selection and reading speed setting (Speech Settings dialog)
	Speak faster / Speak slower commands, settings saved in SpeechPlugin.ini
	Optional right-click menu entries
	English and French menus (automatic: same language as Notepad++)
	Fixed: crash on ANSI documents with non UTF-8 characters
	Fixed: 64-bit text positions (SCI_GETTEXTRANGEFULL)
	Fixed: voice released while speaking, XML/HTML text parsed as SAPI markup

